MAIN
MOVE TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 10 HALLOCATE TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 A_callFun
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 15 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 )
PRINT TEMP 15
END
A_callFun [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 16 10
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 16
L0 MOVE TEMP 17 0
MOVE TEMP 18 NE TEMP 3 TEMP 17
CJUMP TEMP 18 L1
MOVE TEMP 19 10
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 20
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 22 PLUS TEMP 21 TEMP 3
PRINT TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 1
MOVE TEMP 24 MINUS TEMP 3 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 24
JUMP L0
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 25 1
MOVE TEMP 26 0
MOVE TEMP 27 NE TEMP 3 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 28 MINUS TEMP 25 TEMP 27

RETURN TEMP 28
END

